        "content": "<p>xia-chao edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14514\">PR #14514</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A huge -Wmax-wasm-stack crashes the CLI, because deriving the async stack size from it overflows,<br>\nwhile zero is already rejected with a clear error. Such a value still fails later on a 32-bit<br>\ntarget, when the stack it asks for cannot be allocated -- that is how Store::new already behaves.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
